<section class="hero"><div aria-hidden="true" class="hero-art"><img alt="" height="1000" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" src="/assets/img/hero-douala-concept.webp" width="1500"/></div><div class="hero-shade"></div><div class="shell hero-content"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="hairline"></span>00 / CAMEROON ROOTS. LONG-TERM PERSPECTIVE.</div><h1>Businesses built for the long view.</h1><p>From Douala, Blue Line Capital Group brings property, construction, manufacturing, trade and operational functions into one disciplined business perspective.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-accent" href="/en/businesses/"><span>Explore the portfolio</span><span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/en/contact/"><span>Start a conversation</span><span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></div><div class="hero-aside"><div class="hero-small">A GROUP WITH A LONG VIEW</div><span>CM / 04&deg;03&prime; N &middot; 09&deg;42&prime; E</span></div></div><div class="hero-bottom shell"><span>DOUALA &middot; CAMEROON</span><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE <b aria-hidden="true">&darr;</b></span></div></section><section class="intro section shell"><div class="intro-heading"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="hairline"></span>01 / A group perspective</div><h2>Connected businesses. Distinct expertise.</h2></div><div class="intro-text"><p>From property and construction to trade, financial operations and technology, our work is connected by the belief that capable enterprises create lasting value when supported by clear thinking and responsible execution.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/about/">Our Group <span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></section><section class="portfolio-atlas" aria-labelledby="atlas-heading"><div class="shell atlas-layout"><div class="atlas-aside"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="hairline"></span>01.5 / AN OPERATING UNIVERSE</div><h2 id="atlas-heading">A clearer view of the Group.</h2><p>Nine areas, each